module

public import Theory.SpecificGroups.Fischer.AtlasCarriers.Fi22CentralizerAction

/-!
# A relation for the Fi22 fixed-point kernel certificate

These are the closed neighborhoods discovered from the suborbit of length 693
in the ATLAS degree-3510 action. They define a concrete Boolean relation only:
its invariance under the actual generators and its separation of involution
orbits must be proved in certificate extensions.

Source: ATLAS F22G1-p3510B0 and GLS3 Table 5.3t. The reproducible discovery and
encoding scripts are in `Fi22KernelCertificate/source/`. Neither GAP nor Python
is trusted by the Lean proof. Rows and columns use zero-based point labels.
-/

@[expose] public section
